<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif; background-color: #050505; margin: 0; padding: 0; color: #ffffff; }
    .container { max-width: 550px; margin: 40px auto; background-color: #0f0f0f; border: 1px solid #222; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; }
    .content { padding: 40px; }
    .badge-cancel { display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 100px; background: #450a0a; color: #f87171; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px; text-transform: uppercase; border: 1px solid #991b1b; }
    h1 { font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 10px; color: #ffffff; }
    p { color: #a1a1aa; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 15px; }
    .refund-notice { background: #022c22; border-radius: 8px; padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #064e3b; margin: 25px 0; }
    .btn-secondary { display: inline-block; background: #27272a; color: #ffffff !important; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; border: 1px solid #3f3f46; }
    .footer { padding: 20px 40px; background: #0a0a0a; border-top: 1px solid #1a1a1a; color: #52525b; font-size: 12px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="content">
      <div class="badge-cancel">Cancelled</div>
      <h1>Subscription Stopped</h1>
      <p>We've processed your request, <%= userName %>. Your subscription is now cancelled.</p>
      
      <% if (refunded) { %>
        <div class="refund-notice">
          <p style="color: #6ee7b7; margin: 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;">
            <strong>Refund Confirmed:</strong> A full refund has been initiated. Expect to see the credit in your account within 5-10 business days.
          </p>
        </div>
      <% } else { %>
        <p>You will continue to have access to all premium features until your cycle officially ends on <strong><%= endDate %></strong>.</p>
      <% } %>

      <p style="margin-top: 30px;">If this was a mistake, or if you'd like to try a different plan, you can reactivate anytime from your dashboard.</p>
      <a href="<%= loginUrl %>" class="btn-secondary">Manage Account</a>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">Censura Privacy Policy &bull; Contact Support</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>